      "hear the appeal on that question",
      "hear the appeal on any other substantial question of law",
      "hearing appeals",
      "Grant adjournment",
      "Record reasons for adjournment",
      "Make orders on costs occasioned by adjournment",
      "function at the National Capital Region",
      "perform functions at other notified places",
      "general superintendence",
      "entertain complaints",
      "call for records",
      "pass orders",
      "exercise jurisdiction, powers and authority",
      "declare terms of contract null and void",
      "review any of the order passed by it",
      "set aside orders",
      "transfer complaints",
      "Approving courier services",
      "declare notice as duly served",
      "direct any individual or organisation or expert to assist",
      "Making orders under sub-clause (i) or (ii) of clause (a) of sub-section (1) of section 58",
      "condoning delay",
      "laying down standards",
